==================================================================================================
WIDTH REDUCTION:  is a narrower design free?
==================================================================================================
  5 paired seeds x 20 epochs, r0 = 0.6 (tuned for res4/ns3, so biased toward the incumbent).
  'diff' is paired against the shipped arm; POSITIVE = worse.

  Heisenberg N=4   exact -6.4641   ansatz 4q  M=16
    arm                         mean      diff      sem  width  depth
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    res4 ns3  (shipped)      -5.9518        --       --     13     27
    res3 ns3  (no fold)      -5.9003    0.0516   0.0299     12     25
    res4 ns2                 -5.9285    0.0233   0.0261     12     29
    res4 ns1                 -5.9433    0.0085   0.0413     11     41
    res3 ns1  (both)         -5.8778    0.0741   0.0271     10     39

  Heisenberg N=6   exact -9.9743   ansatz 6q  M=24
    arm                         mean      diff      sem  width  depth
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    res4 ns3  (shipped)      -8.7056        --       --     15     45
    res3 ns3  (no fold)      -8.5035    0.2022   0.1129     14     43
    res4 ns2                 -8.9324   -0.2267   0.2308     14     39
    res4 ns1                 -8.9413   -0.2357   0.2389     13     59
    res3 ns1  (both)         -8.8716   -0.1660   0.2241     12     57

  H2 Molecule   exact -1.8573   ansatz 2q  M=8
    arm                         mean      diff      sem  width  depth
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    res4 ns3  (shipped)      -1.8449        --       --     10     19
    res3 ns3  (no fold)      -1.8429    0.0020   0.0030      9     17
    res4 ns2                 -1.8422    0.0027   0.0041      9     19
    res4 ns1                 -1.8435    0.0014   0.0024      8     23
    res3 ns1  (both)         -1.8464   -0.0015   0.0029      7     21

==================================================================================================
READING IT
==================================================================================================
  An arm whose paired diff is inside ~2 SEM is FREE: it gives the qubits
  back at no measurable cost in energy, and width is the axis V6 loses.
  An arm that is free AND shallower is strictly better than the shipped
  default and should become it. An arm that is free but DEEPER is a
  genuine trade and belongs as a knob, like resolution.
  Note r0 favours the incumbent, so a tie understates the alternative.
